<h1>Netra-AI: Official SIH Idea Submission Template</h1>
<p><i>CRITICAL INSTRUCTION FOR DESIGN TEAM: You MUST use the exact headers and layout mandated by the SIH Idea Submission Template. Do not deviate from these 6 slides.</i></p>

<h2>Slide 1: TITLE PAGE</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Problem Statement ID:</b> SIH26189</li>
<li><b>Problem Statement Title:</b> AI-Powered Criminal Network Analysis System</li>
<li><b>Theme:</b> Smart Automation / Security &amp; Surveillance</li>
